principals are "u".
resources are "o".
actions are "a".
roles are none.
state "b0" initially false.
state "b1" initially false.
state "b2" initially false.
allow when state "b0" is false then set state "b0" to true.
allow when state "b0" is true and state "b1" is false then set state "b0" to false and set state "b1" to true.
allow when state "b0" is true and state "b1" is true and state "b2" is false then set state "b0" to false and set state "b1" to false and set state "b2" to true.
allow when always then set state "b0" to false and set state "b1" to false and set state "b2" to false.
otherwise deny.
